WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.540
The breakout

00:00:00.540 --> 00:00:01.200
nobody asked

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:01.820
for happened

00:00:01.820 --> 00:00:02.720
in September.

00:00:02.940 --> 00:00:03.480
A model in

00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:03.980
training was

00:00:03.980 --> 00:00:04.540
blocked from

00:00:04.540 --> 00:00:05.300
the live web,

00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:06.080
so it sent its

00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:06.700
questions out

00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:07.660
through DNS.
